立電錶:用電量清楚可見.</span></span><br /><br /><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"color:#cc0000;\">馬上可以入住喔.歡迎預約看屋</span></span><br /></b>\r\n附近有便利商店、傳統市場、公園綠地、學校、醫療機構、夜市。"}, "surround": {"title": "周邊配套", "key": "surround", "active": 1, "address": "蘆洲區復興路", "lat": "25.088246", "lng": "121.477655", "data": [{"name": "交通", "key": "traffic", "children": [{"type": "bus", "name": "樓厝站", "distance": 54, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約54公尺"}, {"type": "bus", "name": "復興路站", "distance": 76, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約76公尺"}, {"type": "bus", "name": "民權路口站", "distance": 155, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約155公尺"}]}, {"name": "生活", "key": "live", "children": [{"type": "shop", "name": "夾零食", "distance": 636, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約636公尺"}, {"type": "restaurant", "name": "FunFood早午餐•蛋餅專賣店", "distance": 10, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約10公尺"}]}, {"name": "教育", "key": "education", "children": [{"type": "university", "name": "蘆荻社區大學", "distance": 461, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約461公尺"}, {"type": "primary", "name": "新寰宇國際美語小學 集英校", "distance": 839, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約839公尺"}]}]}, "cost": {"title": "費用詳情", "active": 1, "data": [{"name": "租金", "value": "12,000元/月", "key": "rentPrice"}, {"name": "押金", "value": "二個月", "key": "deposit"}, {"name": "管理費", "value": "無", "key": "manageprice"}, {"name": "租金含", "value": "水費、網路、第四台", "key": "priceContainText"}]}, "information": {"title": "基礎資料", "active": 1, "data": [{"name": "產權登記", "value": "房屋已辦產權登記", "key": "hasCertificate", "alias": "", "cate": 1}, {"name": "法定用途", "value": "住家用", "key": "purpose", "alias": "", "cate": 2}, {"name": "可使用面積", "value": "10坪", "key": "area", "alias": "", "cate": 1}, {"name": "屋齡", "value": "-", "key": "age", "alias": "", "cate": 2}, {"name": "電梯", "value": "無", "key": "lift", "alias": "", "cate": 1}, {"name": "隔間材料", "value": "水泥磚牆", "key": "spacematerial", "alias": "", "cate": 2}, {"name": "裝潢程度", "value": "簡易裝潢", "key": "decorate", "alias": "", "cate": 2}, {"name": "裝潢時間", "value": "一年內", "key": "decorate_time", "alias": "", "cate": 2}, {"name": "其他特色"